<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina's Cresud farm firm Q1 net $1.6 mln.</title>
<headline>Argentina's Cresud farm firm Q1 net $1.6 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period ended Sept 30 Net $1.6 million vs n/a Note: Net assets were $88 million. No comparative figures were given. Full name is Cresud Sociedad Anonima, Inmobilaria, Financiera y Agropecuaria.</p>
<p>-- Buenos Aires Newsroom, 541 3180655</p>
